    "detailed_description": "Salio is a minimalistic, but still a super hard platform game about getting a tiny fellow through numerous rooms filled with various obstacles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/875810/extras/2312c297281cbc646aaffbc8ae3d5c2a.avif?t=1627383862\" /></div><br><br>Reflex, coordination are what is needed to finish this extremely difficult platformer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br><br>Tough levels, interesting mechanics, tight controls, secrets to find about and many more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Story mode with many levels</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Workshop mode with your or other player's self-made levels (Steam Workshop support)</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Support for Lua modding</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rewarding achievements</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level Editor</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/875810/extras/d1bb763d3269399d561e1f0ac4b26142.poster.avif?t=1627383862\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/875810/extras/d1bb763d3269399d561e1f0ac4b26142.apng?t=1627383862\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Create, edit and publish your or other player's custom levels using an user friendly level editor!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lua Modding Support</h2> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/875810/extras/6dc8d3df793514e100911ad04c6d5f42.poster.avif?t=1627383862\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/875810/extras/6dc8d3df793514e100911ad04c6d5f42.gif?t=1627383862\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Modify and add new content into the game with the help of Lua based modding!",
